      },
      "description": "`late` reports nothing for the first three timestamps. The option reference warns that a theme river needs \"an event or theme with a complete time quantum as main river … once they are beyond the main river, the layout would be wrong\". ECharts 6.1.0 satisfies that itself: `ThemeRiverSeriesModel.fixData` zero-fills every layer to the **union** of observed timestamps, so the converter emits observed points only and this still lays out correctly. If the `late` band ever renders detached or misaligned, that assumption has broken.",
